WEBVTT

00:00:03.230 --> 00:00:07.900
6 Months Ago

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:14.160
Shhh...

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:16.280
Good morning!

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:18.660
GBR-2.

00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:20.120
GBR-3.

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:22.710
Good morning...

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.880
Good morning, Dr. Shishioh.

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:28.960
Ah! So you recognize me, do you?

00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:30.590
Yes.

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:33.880
Data analysis confirmed your identity.

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:36.220
Set-up completed.

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:38.720
Artificial Intelligence System GBR-2...

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:40.850
...activated at 14 hours, 25 minutes, 11 seconds...

00:00:40.930 --> 00:00:45.810
...with GBR-3 following at 14 hours, 25 minutes, 16 seconds.

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:47.110
We did it!

00:00:47.310 --> 00:00:50.020
We've created a new generation of A.I. systems!

00:00:59.240 --> 00:01:04.290
HyoRyu and EnRyu's test runs are all going well.

00:01:04.370 --> 00:01:07.130
However, they remain hindered in their ability to perform the...

00:01:07.210 --> 00:01:10.750
...instantaneous energy control necessary for "System Change."

00:01:10.880 --> 00:01:13.090
The cause is still being investigated.

00:01:13.170 --> 00:01:16.170
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:16.170 --> 00:01:19.070
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:20.140 --> 00:01:26.060
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:01:26.420 --> 00:01:30.070
Rise in fury, Steel Cyborg!

00:01:32.190 --> 00:01:36.790
With your red mane and golden arms!

00:01:38.110 --> 00:01:41.070
Your G-Stone sparkling in the sun...

00:01:41.070 --> 00:01:45.990
All the world's hope is in your hands.

00:01:45.990 --> 00:01:49.910
Your time has come to make a stand!

00:01:49.910 --> 00:01:52.710
Crushing the hopes of the people...

00:01:52.710 --> 00:01:56.470
The Zonders will pay the price!

00:01:58.620 --> 00:02:01.470
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:02:01.470 --> 00:02:04.640
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:04.640 --> 00:02:07.180
Final Fusion, approved!

00:02:07.380 --> 00:02:10.310
Now transform into a superhero!

00:02:10.310 --> 00:02:13.270
Warping dimensional space!

00:02:13.520 --> 00:02:17.350
Dividing Driver!

00:02:19.170 --> 00:02:24.990
A miracle! A mystery! The truth! A dream!

00:02:24.990 --> 00:02:30.870
A gigantic, invincible guardian is born!

00:02:30.870 --> 00:02:33.820
Our very own King of Braves!

00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:37.710
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:37.300 --> 00:02:39.720
This is the story of the brave men and women...

00:02:39.880 --> 00:02:42.930
...who fight with all their hearts to save mankind.

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:45.140
Blue and Red

00:02:46.310 --> 00:02:47.600
<i>Blue and Red</i>

00:03:02.820 --> 00:03:08.080
I never expected to encounter such a robot here on Earth.

00:03:16.590 --> 00:03:20.380
I see that it is finally my turn to take the stage!

00:03:20.880 --> 00:03:25.760
Let me entrance you with the beguiling dance of Primarda!

00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:31.640
Um, those of you who might get car-sick...

00:03:31.770 --> 00:03:34.810
...make sure you're sitting by the windows, all right?

00:03:42.110 --> 00:03:43.820
If you ever sense any Zonders...

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:47.240
...be sure to contact me with that pager, all right?

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:53.500
Hey, what's that? A pager?

00:03:53.620 --> 00:03:56.040
Yeah. I guess you could call it that.

00:03:56.290 --> 00:03:59.260
Oh yeah? So you've got one of those things too, Mamoru?

00:03:59.420 --> 00:04:00.510
Lucky you!

00:04:01.010 --> 00:04:04.930
The gadget I use is a combined PHS, cell phone, pager...

00:04:05.010 --> 00:04:08.220
...satellite communications tool, and hyper-speed modem...

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:11.350
...plus high-capacity voice memory and much, much more!

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:15.310
It's a cutting-edge PDA with every possible built-in function...

00:04:15.480 --> 00:04:17.770
...so it's hard to operate!

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:21.900
Your no-frills pager looks way more user-friendly!

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:24.070
Hey, let me see that thing, Takayasu!

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:26.620
No way, you always break my stuff, Ushi!

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:28.700
Hey, I want to see it, too!

00:04:29.990 --> 00:04:34.120
Gosh, I even have to bring this pager with me on a field trip...

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:37.210
...it's kind of a pain in the neck!

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:51.470
They just can't manage to reach their GS-Ride power target.

00:04:51.680 --> 00:04:56.810
To do a System Change, they must go over 80% in total energy levels.

00:04:56.940 --> 00:04:59.360
And the cause for that is unknown?

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:00.230
Seems that way.

00:05:00.980 --> 00:05:04.150
Forgive us. Try as we might, we can't raise our power output.

00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:08.070
We did think we were going to make it today, but...

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:09.990
Now, now, don't worry about it.

00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:15.410
In six months, your A.I. systems have matured more or less 100%.

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:19.750
I guess for a GS-Ride we copied using the technology available on Earth...

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:21.630
...this is the best we can do?

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:24.340
Yes. Although theoretically, it is possible...

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:29.100
Vehicle Machines equipped with Super A.I. Systems, HyoRyu and EnRyu.

00:05:29.260 --> 00:05:31.890
But without the aid of technology beyond human understanding...

00:05:32.010 --> 00:05:34.100
...they can never be complete.

00:05:41.650 --> 00:05:42.320
Jeez!

00:05:42.440 --> 00:05:43.480
Stop that honking!

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:46.650
The cars ahead of me won't budge, so what am I supposed to do?

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:49.320
Yo ski bum, some of us are working, you know!

00:05:50.070 --> 00:05:51.910
Gimme a break!

00:05:52.030 --> 00:05:54.200
Jamming up the roads every single day!

00:05:56.870 --> 00:05:58.170
Nothing doing here, either?

00:05:58.500 --> 00:06:02.340
What's the point of maping software when all the roads are backed up?

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:04.050
What a useless piece of junk!

00:06:04.710 --> 00:06:08.010
I don't believe this! Everywhere I go!

00:06:08.340 --> 00:06:11.680
Crap, I never should've bought this lame car navigation system!

00:06:15.270 --> 00:06:16.980
Huh? What's going on?

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:18.520
You're telling me to go that way?

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:30.200
Hey, it's a dead end, for crying out loud!

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:31.660
Gosh darn it!

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:37.040
What's going on?

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:42.750
You hate traffic jams...

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:44.630
If only there weren't any traffic jams...

00:06:45.460 --> 00:06:47.550
What are you, a new kind of traffic cop?

00:06:48.170 --> 00:06:51.470
I am here to grant you your heart's desire...

00:06:52.300 --> 00:06:56.390
That's right, I am the Dancer of Love...

00:06:56.810 --> 00:06:59.310
Dancer of Love?

00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:01.650
You hate...

00:07:02.020 --> 00:07:03.230
...traffic jams...

00:07:03.940 --> 00:07:07.150
That's right, you hate traffic jams with all your heart!

00:07:07.530 --> 00:07:10.150
Well, sure, I do hate traffic jams, but...

00:07:10.320 --> 00:07:12.030
Then it's settled.

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:13.490
It's settled, is it not?

00:07:13.620 --> 00:07:15.450
What do you mean, settled?

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:22.460
I hate...

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:25.290
hate traffic jams!

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:33.090
So beautiful<i>...</i>

00:07:33.390 --> 00:07:35.050
What a feast for the eyes!

00:07:42.310 --> 00:07:44.940
All right, time to use my secret weapon...

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:46.570
Hey, but that's cheating!

00:07:46.860 --> 00:07:49.400
Whatever you say, a win's a win!

00:07:50.700 --> 00:07:53.200
Thanks for giving up your monster!

00:07:54.910 --> 00:07:56.410
Hey, Mamoru, it's your turn.

00:07:58.410 --> 00:07:59.250
Huh?

00:07:59.410 --> 00:08:01.750
Mamoru, get revenge for me, will you?

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:02.750
Gotcha!

00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:07.420
I bet that was just my imagination!

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:11.170
Although Mamoru has the ability to sense a Zonder's presence...

00:08:11.300 --> 00:08:15.340
...he is so wrapped up in his game that his power has lost its edge.

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:18.310
Temperature, 22 degrees, humidity 30%.

00:08:18.430 --> 00:08:20.680
Chance of rain less than 10%.

00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:24.690
Traffic conditions are atrocious, streets are backed up all over the city.

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:28.110
As of this moment, things are pretty much the same as always.

00:08:28.230 --> 00:08:30.530
I can't believe how much you Japanese put up with...

00:08:30.690 --> 00:08:33.030
Your homes are so tiny, and your streets are narrow, too!

00:08:33.490 --> 00:08:36.950
Not only that, but the working conditions are seriously no good!

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:38.950
Let's cut him some slack...

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:42.370
...he was having problems with the calculations for the...

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:45.250
...Vehicle Machines' power-up levels and he pulled another all-nighter.

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:51.300
Well, this coffee you make is the one thing you can't get in America.

00:08:51.420 --> 00:08:54.300
This bitter taste, there's nothing like it in the world!

00:09:00.770 --> 00:09:01.220
What?

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:06.060
In Tokyo Area 14J, there's been a serious accident!

00:09:06.190 --> 00:09:07.690
Is it another Zonder?

00:09:08.060 --> 00:09:11.570
The Early-Warning Satellite System hasn't been able to confirm that.

00:09:12.530 --> 00:09:15.530
The local police are on their way to the accident site.

00:09:16.110 --> 00:09:18.620
Since we haven't heard from Mamoru...

00:09:18.990 --> 00:09:21.410
...it should be safe to assume it's just an ordinary accident.

00:09:23.500 --> 00:09:25.290
Traffic jams and car accidents...

00:09:25.410 --> 00:09:26.790
One crisis after another!

00:09:31.130 --> 00:09:33.590
Oh! Now that's what I call a crisis!

00:09:40.970 --> 00:09:42.010
Hey, what the heck is that?

00:09:47.900 --> 00:09:49.690
I-It's a monster truck!

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:55.440
We're going to get crushed!

00:09:58.410 --> 00:10:00.280
Zonder!

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:12.460
It's getting more exquisite by the second!

00:10:12.590 --> 00:10:16.340
My darling Pretty Wheeler...

00:10:16.510 --> 00:10:18.970
Push on, as far as you can.

00:10:19.140 --> 00:10:21.930
This planet is overrun with vehicles...

00:10:22.050 --> 00:10:24.640
Don't stop until you've crushed every last one of them!

00:10:31.440 --> 00:10:33.360
We're hardly moving at all, are we?

00:10:33.520 --> 00:10:35.570
I wonder if there was an accident or something?

00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:38.990
It's a lot more congested than usual, you know!

00:10:39.530 --> 00:10:40.910
Is it really?

00:10:42.320 --> 00:10:44.910
Hey, you're putting up a pretty good fight, Mamoru!

00:10:45.330 --> 00:10:47.830
All right! I'm going to try a magical attack next!

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:51.830
Don't think you're going to beat me!

00:10:54.550 --> 00:10:57.010
Mamoru, there's something strange about your hair!

00:10:57.170 --> 00:10:59.720
Waha! It's just bedhead, that's all!

00:10:59.930 --> 00:11:02.010
I guess you toss around in your sleep a lot.

00:11:05.260 --> 00:11:07.020
What's going on, Teacher?

00:11:14.900 --> 00:11:16.690
Zonder!

00:11:17.070 --> 00:11:18.860
It's a monster truck!

00:11:19.070 --> 00:11:20.030
And it's coming this way!

00:11:22.990 --> 00:11:24.830
Then, I did sense something before...

00:11:45.970 --> 00:11:48.720
Blast it, that robot's absorbing all the cars it's trampled on...

00:11:48.930 --> 00:11:50.850
It's supersizing endlessly!

00:11:53.020 --> 00:11:55.440
Not detecting it sooner was a big blow for us.

00:11:56.230 --> 00:11:58.190
Have you heard from Mamoru?

00:11:58.360 --> 00:11:59.570
No, I haven't.

00:11:59.900 --> 00:12:01.820
Huh! Just goes to show you, a kid's a kid.

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:03.990
When push comes to shove, they're useless!

00:12:04.110 --> 00:12:05.780
Look at that!

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:09.830
It's even bigger now, guys!

00:12:12.670 --> 00:12:17.250
If only I'd told them sooner about detecting the Zonder...

00:12:19.800 --> 00:12:21.800
Huh? How could Mamoru be so careless?

00:12:33.230 --> 00:12:35.850
Mamoru!

00:12:36.150 --> 00:12:37.270
Hana!

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:49.740
Teacher, save us!

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:56.540
Because of me, we're all gonna...

00:13:04.760 --> 00:13:05.800
Forward!

00:13:07.090 --> 00:13:09.640
Gai here. There are scores of civilians in danger.

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:12.520
When will the Dividing Driver be ready?

00:13:13.140 --> 00:13:15.850
It's going to take two hours just to finish the repairs!

00:13:18.520 --> 00:13:19.820
We don't have two hours!

00:13:21.190 --> 00:13:23.240
I can't possibly fight under these circumstances!

00:13:27.660 --> 00:13:29.830
Chief! If we send in HyoRyu and EnRyu...

00:13:31.200 --> 00:13:34.750
As Vehicle Machines trained in rescue work, perhaps they could...

00:13:35.210 --> 00:13:36.420
There's no other way.

00:13:36.670 --> 00:13:38.830
They might not be able to achieve System Change...

00:13:38.960 --> 00:13:41.880
...but rescue work should pose no problems for them.

00:13:42.090 --> 00:13:44.050
A.I. systems normal!

00:13:44.260 --> 00:13:46.220
I'm sure they're more than up to the job!

00:13:49.510 --> 00:13:52.180
How about it, you two? Think you can handle it?

00:13:52.770 --> 00:13:54.390
You can count on us, sir.

00:13:54.600 --> 00:13:57.060
We promise to live up to your expectations!

00:13:57.190 --> 00:14:00.610
All right! HyoRyu! EnRyu!

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:03.400
Time for Emergency Launch!

00:14:03.570 --> 00:14:06.900
Go rescue those people who've been left behind!

00:14:07.030 --> 00:14:08.360
Give it all you've got!

00:14:28.220 --> 00:14:29.970
I'm not afraid, I'm not afraid...

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:31.470
I'm not afraid...

00:14:31.600 --> 00:14:33.180
Actually I'm terrified!

00:14:39.980 --> 00:14:41.440
It's all my fault...

00:14:41.560 --> 00:14:45.230
If I hadn't been so lost in that stupid game, this never would've happened!

00:14:49.860 --> 00:14:50.740
Gai!

00:14:51.120 --> 00:14:53.620
Don't even think about coming any closer!

00:14:59.920 --> 00:15:01.290
Gai!

00:15:03.590 --> 00:15:04.460
What?

00:15:06.090 --> 00:15:08.220
Zonder!

00:15:11.550 --> 00:15:13.260
So you've got some weapons of your own, huh?

00:15:17.640 --> 00:15:20.480
Give me a break! I'm no car!

00:15:20.770 --> 00:15:22.860
Are you trying to turn me into scrap metal?

00:15:29.070 --> 00:15:31.700
Well done, my sweet Pretty Wheeler!

00:15:32.740 --> 00:15:35.490
If he's unable to move freely...

00:15:35.660 --> 00:15:38.790
...he won't be able to transform into that black robot.

00:15:39.000 --> 00:15:42.540
Now then, go ahead and crush him to pieces!

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:46.090
Zonder!

00:15:57.350 --> 00:15:59.220
Hey, look over there!

00:16:07.860 --> 00:16:09.360
HyoRyu!

00:16:09.610 --> 00:16:11.030
EnRyu!

00:16:20.410 --> 00:16:22.870
Stay calm! Now climb down one at a time!

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:24.710
Oh boy, we're saved!

00:16:24.830 --> 00:16:26.750
I thought our number was up for sure!

00:16:27.340 --> 00:16:29.920
Children, hurry, let's get out of here!

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:33.050
Hana!

00:16:34.050 --> 00:16:34.930
Mamoru!

00:16:35.800 --> 00:16:37.850
Oh, here! This is important to you, isn't it?

00:16:38.390 --> 00:16:41.770
I'm sorry! It's my fault you...

00:16:42.060 --> 00:16:44.190
Move it! Hurry it up!

00:16:47.190 --> 00:16:48.940
All right, let them down easy!

00:16:49.650 --> 00:16:52.030
The Self-Defense Force rescue team has arrived.

00:16:52.150 --> 00:16:54.610
They've got both the rescue and the fire under control!

00:16:55.070 --> 00:16:57.030
GaiGar's reinforcement frame is in the red zone!

00:16:57.370 --> 00:16:58.950
He won't last another minute!

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:09.460
All I need is to achieve Final Fusion, then he'd be toast...

00:17:10.130 --> 00:17:11.550
Captain!

00:17:13.760 --> 00:17:15.970
Zonder!

00:17:18.890 --> 00:17:22.770
GaiGar, HyoRyu and EnRyu are about to be crushed into scrap metal!

00:17:22.930 --> 00:17:24.770
A System Change is our only hope!

00:17:25.140 --> 00:17:27.400
But they've never once succeeded in the simulations!

00:17:27.560 --> 00:17:29.440
Are you really going to make them wing it?

00:17:29.820 --> 00:17:33.110
It is time to find out whether or not they are true heroes.

00:17:33.240 --> 00:17:35.490
HyoRyu, EnRyu! System Change, hurry!

00:17:35.780 --> 00:17:38.410
No good! The GS-Ride power output isn't going up!

00:17:39.030 --> 00:17:41.950
Why? Why isn't the GS-Ride working?

00:17:42.290 --> 00:17:44.330
Tell us how to boost our power output!

00:17:48.380 --> 00:17:51.090
All of you, for gosh sake!

00:17:51.170 --> 00:17:53.800
I hate you, Zonder!

00:17:57.340 --> 00:17:58.010
What's this?

00:18:00.300 --> 00:18:01.720
What just happened?

00:18:01.850 --> 00:18:02.760
What's going on?

00:18:02.850 --> 00:18:04.930
There's been a huge surge of energy!

00:18:05.140 --> 00:18:09.770
HyoRyu and EnRyu's GS-Ride power output has shot up to 200%!

00:18:10.400 --> 00:18:11.690
It's incalculable!

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:13.610
No, that couldn't be it...

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:15.530
Then what the heck is going on?

00:18:15.780 --> 00:18:18.320
Hey, look! Look at HyoRyu and EnRyu!

00:18:19.740 --> 00:18:22.530
System Change!

00:18:39.050 --> 00:18:39.760
HyoRyu!

00:18:39.890 --> 00:18:40.970
EnRyu!

00:18:45.140 --> 00:18:47.020
Freezing Gun!

00:18:51.520 --> 00:18:53.230
Melting Gun!

00:18:55.230 --> 00:18:57.570
All right! Now the Zonder Robot can't move anymore!

00:18:58.240 --> 00:18:59.910
HyoRyu! EnRyu!

00:19:01.490 --> 00:19:03.700
We've got him.

00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:06.410
Hurry! Go for Final Fusion!

00:19:06.540 --> 00:19:07.370
Right!

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:11.580
Final Fusion!

00:19:39.320 --> 00:19:43.740
GaoGaiGar!

00:19:45.910 --> 00:19:49.040
Hell and Heaven!

00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:52.210
HyoRyu! EnRyu!

00:19:52.420 --> 00:19:53.750
Once I've ripped out the core...

00:19:53.830 --> 00:19:56.090
...get this Zonder Robo as far away from the city as you can!

00:19:56.420 --> 00:19:57.210
Roger!

00:20:08.600 --> 00:20:09.560
Let's do it, EnRyu!

00:20:09.680 --> 00:20:10.640
I'm with you, HyoRyu!

00:20:18.440 --> 00:20:20.240
Power Crane!

00:20:20.400 --> 00:20:21.860
Power Ladder!

00:20:41.300 --> 00:20:45.430
Curses! A Red Robot and a Blue Robot this time?

00:20:46.510 --> 00:20:51.310
Thanks to those ugly brutes, my little Pretty Wheeler's wrecked...

00:20:52.310 --> 00:20:54.270
I'll make you pay for this!

00:20:57.900 --> 00:20:59.820
Curatio...

00:21:00.320 --> 00:21:03.450
...teneritas, sectio...

00:21:04.110 --> 00:21:07.780
...salus, coctura!

00:21:22.670 --> 00:21:24.300
Hey thanks, Mamoru!

00:21:27.470 --> 00:21:32.180
Gai, if I'd let you know sooner, this wouldn't have happened...

00:21:32.640 --> 00:21:35.640
Listen, Mamoru, everybody makes mistakes.

00:21:35.850 --> 00:21:38.190
We just need to cover each other's backs when they happen.

00:21:38.730 --> 00:21:40.820
That's what teamwork is all about!

00:21:41.190 --> 00:21:42.030
Gai...

00:21:42.610 --> 00:21:45.030
We're not alone in this battle...

00:21:45.280 --> 00:21:48.450
We're all part of the GGG team, all fighting for the same thing.

00:21:48.620 --> 00:21:51.700
Mamoru, I'm proud to call you my teammate.

00:21:51.870 --> 00:21:52.910
My name is HyoRyu.

00:21:53.620 --> 00:21:55.290
Let's show them what we're made of!

00:21:55.370 --> 00:21:56.830
My name is EnRyu.

00:21:57.460 --> 00:21:58.250
Okay!

00:21:58.380 --> 00:21:59.580
Yay!

00:22:01.460 --> 00:22:07.010
Good job, Gai, HyoRyu, EnRyu and Mamoru.

00:22:07.550 --> 00:22:11.930
That GS-Ride power boost, was that Mamoru again?

00:22:12.850 --> 00:22:17.850
GGG's newest members, the Vehicle Machines, HyoRyu and EnRyu.

00:22:18.440 --> 00:22:23.190
In the coming battles, these two will hold the Key to Victory!

00:22:30.410 --> 00:22:31.990
No need to rush, no need to rush.

00:22:32.080 --> 00:22:34.580
Japan's a cramped country, so let's just take it slow and easy...

00:22:46.450 --> 00:22:50.350
You come floating down onto my planet.

00:22:51.550 --> 00:22:55.220
That's the dream I always have.

00:22:56.620 --> 00:23:01.400
Now you're looking up at the sky again...

00:23:01.400 --> 00:23:06.190
and you're searching for me.

00:23:06.820 --> 00:23:10.360
Longing to see you and be with you...

00:23:11.530 --> 00:23:17.290
I know I feel it just as strongly as you.

00:23:19.350 --> 00:23:24.050
When you and I are grown up...

00:23:24.050 --> 00:23:28.710
someday in the Sea of Stars.

00:23:29.400 --> 00:23:34.050
Give us the wings to fly

00:23:34.050 --> 00:23:40.950
and set off into the galaxy.

00:23:44.940 --> 00:23:47.900
Now releasing the latest intelligence.

00:23:48.280 --> 00:23:52.780
When the SympaRate of HyoRyu and EnRyu, the GGG's newest members...

00:23:52.990 --> 00:23:56.200
...come into sync, they'll achieve the miraculous Symmetrical Docking.

00:23:56.410 --> 00:23:58.790
And the high-powered tool, Eraser Head...

00:23:58.910 --> 00:24:01.290
...don't miss the chance to power it up!

00:24:01.500 --> 00:24:04.040
Next episode of GaoGaiGar, the King of Braves...

00:24:04.170 --> 00:24:06.460
"His Name Is ChoRyuJin"

00:24:06.540 --> 00:24:10.550
Make sure you stay tuned for the order..."Final Fusion Approved!"

00:24:06.840 --> 00:24:10.510
His Name Is ChoRyuJin

00:24:12.930 --> 00:24:15.930
Eraser Head

00:24:13.640 --> 00:24:15.260
This is the Key to Victory!
